# 邀请信


## 写作框架
第一段：自我介绍 + 邀请目的
第二段：活动详情（时间、地点、内容）
第三段：期待对方接受 + 表达感谢

## 万能句型
### 开头句
1. I am writing to invite you to...
2. It is with great pleasure that I invite you to attend...
3. On behalf of..., I cordially invite you to...

### 中间句
1. The event is scheduled to take place on... at...
2. During the event, there will be... including...
3. We have arranged a variety of activities, such as...

### 结尾句
1. I would be delighted if you could attend this event.
2. Your presence would be a great honor for us.
3. I am looking forward to your favorable reply at your earliest convenience.

## 真题范文（2020-2026）
### 2022年真题
**题目**: Write an email to a foreign professor, inviting him to attend a graduation ceremony.
**范文**:
Dear Professor Johnson,

I am writing to cordially invite you to attend the graduation ceremony of our university, which will be held on June 30th in the main auditorium.

The ceremony will commence at 9:00 a.m. and will include addresses by distinguished alumni, the awarding of degrees, and a reception afterward. As one of the most respected professors in our department, your presence would be a great honor for all the graduates. We would also be grateful if you could deliver a brief speech to inspire the graduating class.

Your presence would mean a great deal to us. I am looking forward to your favorable reply.

Yours sincerely,
Li Ming

**亮点词汇/句型**: `cordially invite`, `commence at`, `distinguished alumni`, `deliver a brief speech`

## 预测范文
### 预测题1
**题目**: Write a letter to invite a foreign friend to participate in a cultural exchange activity.
**范文**:
Dear Tom,

I am writing to invite you to participate in a cultural exchange activity organized by our student union. The event will take place on the afternoon of May 15th in the Student Center.

During the activity, participants from different countries will showcase their traditional customs, cuisines, and art forms. We have arranged various interactive sessions, including calligraphy workshops and folk music performances. It would be wonderful if you could share some aspects of your culture with us.

Your participation would be highly valued. I am looking forward to seeing you there.

Yours sincerely,
Li Ming
